              `<strong>Third Schedule:</strong> Forms of Oaths and Affirmations for Union/State Ministers, Parliament/Legislature candidates &amp; members, Judges, and CAG (excludes President, Vice-President, and Governors, whose oaths sit in Articles 60, 69, and 159).`,
              `<strong>Fourth Schedule:</strong> Allocation of seats in the Council of States (Upper House) to States and Union Territories.`,
              `<strong>Fifth &amp; Sixth Schedules:</strong> Fifth governs Scheduled Areas and Scheduled Tribes in 10 states; Sixth governs Tribal Areas in four northeastern states — Assam, Meghalaya, Tripura, and Mizoram (AMTM).`
