              `<strong>Parts IVA–VI:</strong> Part IVA — Fundamental Duties (Art. 51A, added by 42nd CAA 1976); Part V — The Union Government (Art. 52–151); Part VI — The State Governments (Art. 152–237).`,
              `<strong>Part VII &amp; Parts VIII–IXB:</strong> Part VII was deleted by the 7th CAA 1956; Part VIII — Union Territories (Art. 239–242); Part IX — Panchayats (Art. 243–243O, 73rd CAA 1992); Part IXA — Municipalities (Art. 243P–243ZG, 74th CAA 1992); Part IXB — Co-operative Societies (Art. 243ZH–243ZT, 97th CAA 2011).`,
              `<strong>Parts X–XII:</strong> Part X — Scheduled and Tribal Areas (Art. 244–244A); Part XI — Relations between the Union and the States (Art. 245–263); Part XII — Finance, Property, Contracts, and Suits (Art. 264–300A).`,
              `<strong>Parts XIII–XV:</strong> Part XIII — Trade, Commerce, and Intercourse (Art. 301–307); Part XIV — Services under the Union and the States (Art. 308–323); Part XIVA — Tribunals (Art. 323A–323B, 42nd CAA 1976); Part XV — Elections (Art. 324–329A).`,
              `<strong>Parts XVI–XXII:</strong> Part XVI — Special Provisions for Certain Classes (Art. 330–342A); Part XVII — Official Language (Art. 343–351A); Part XVIII — Emergency Provisions (Art. 352–360); Part XIX — Miscellaneous (Art. 361–367); Part XX — Amendment of the Constitution (Art. 368); Part XXI — Temporary, Transitional and Special Provisions (Art. 369–392); Part XXII — Short Title, Commencement, Authoritative Text in Hindi, and Repeals (Art. 393–395).`
            ],
